    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> A [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=btp6NZvx465nxWTF]] the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see starts its turn within [[lookup @target.template.size activity=btp6NZvx465nxWTF]] feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} and can see the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Response—Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=btp6NZvx465nxWTF]], the triggering [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=btp6NZvx465nxWTF]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition until the end of its turn.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s Unnerving Gaze for 24 hours.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: A creature that starts its turn within range and can see the devil makes the save; a success makes it immune to this devil's gaze for 24 hours. Whether the devil can see it is left to the GM.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
